<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <div><div class="kicker" data-i18n="s1_kicker">01 / Services</div><h2 data-i18n="s1_h1">Top demand<br>in Florida.</h2></div>
    <p data-i18n="s1_desc">The 8 most requested services in hot, humid Florida — plus complementary care. Based in Florida City, serving Miami-Dade and South Florida.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="top-badge" data-i18n="top_badge">TOP DEMAND</span><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card1_num">01 — HVAC</span><h3 data-i18n="card1_h3">Cool air<br>guaranteed.</h3><p data-i18n="card1_p">Critical in Florida heat & humidity. Install, repair and maintenance.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="top-badge" data-i18n="top_badge">TOP DEMAND</span><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card2_num">02 — PLUMBING</span><h3 data-i18n="card2_h3">Flow<br>without leaks.</h3><p data-i18n="card2_p">Consistent year-round demand. Repairs to full installs by licensed plumbers.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="top-badge" data-i18n="top_badge">TOP DEMAND</span><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card3_num">03 — ELECTRICAL</span><h3 data-i18n="card3_h3">Power<br>you trust.</h3><p data-i18n="card3_p">Florida's most in-demand trade. Panels, wiring and lighting by certified electricians.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="top-badge" data-i18n="top_badge">TOP DEMAND</span><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card4_num">04 — ROOFING</span><h3 data-i18n="card4_h3">Roofs built<br>for storms.</h3><p data-i18n="card4_p">Florida leads US roof replacements. Repair and replacement.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="top-badge" data-i18n="top_badge">TOP DEMAND</span><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card5_num">05 — IMPACT WINDOWS</span><h3 data-i18n="card5_h3">Hurricane<br>protection.</h3><p data-i18n="card5_p">Region-specific hurricane demand. Impact windows supply & install.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="top-badge" data-i18n="top_badge">TOP DEMAND</span><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card6_num">06 — POOLS</span><h3 data-i18n="card6_h3">Pools, always<br>ready.</h3><p data-i18n="card6_p">Install and maintenance with recurring service plans.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="top-badge" data-i18n="top_badge">TOP DEMAND</span><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card7_num">07 — PEST CONTROL</span><h3 data-i18n="card7_h3">Zero pests,<br>year-round.</h3><p data-i18n="card7_p">Strong recurring demand in Florida climate. Safe scheduled plans.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
    <article class="glass tilt reveal"><span class="top-badge" data-i18n="top_badge">TOP DEMAND</span><span class="card-num" data-i18n="card8_num">08 — GENERATORS</span><h3 data-i18n="card8_h3">Never<br>without power.</h3><p data-i18n="card8_p">Growing storm-prep demand. Generator install + standby.</p><div class="card-line"></div></article>
  </div>
  <div class="extras reveal">
    <div class="extras-title" data-i18n="extras_title">Also available — complementary services</div>
    <div class="extras-grid">
      <div class="extra"><b data-i18n="extra1_t">Landscaping</b><span data-i18n="extra1_p">Garden & grounds maintenance</span></div>
      <div class="extra"><b data-i18n="extra2_t">Pressure washing</b><span data-i18n="extra2_p">Exterior deep cleaning</span></div>
      <div class="extra"><b data-i18n="extra3_t">Handyman</b><span data-i18n="extra3_p">General repairs & fixes</span></div>
      <div class="extra"><b data-i18n="extra4_t">Home cleaning</b><span data-i18n="extra4_p">Recurring residential cleaning</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 16px }
  .glass { position: relative; min-height: 330px; padding: 27px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.085),rgba(255,255,255,.018));
    box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px); transform-style: preserve-3d; transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .3s ease; overflow: hidden }
  .glass:before { content: ""; position: absolute; width: 190px; height: 190px; right: -80px; top: -80px; background: var(--red); filter: blur(80px); opacity: .14 }
  .glass:hover { box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12) }
  .card-num { font-size: 10px; color: #777e88; letter-spacing: .18em }
  .top-badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .18em; color: #fff; background: var(--red); border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px }
  .extras { margin-top: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px; background: #080a0d }
  .extras-title { font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .22em; color: var(--red); margin-bottom: 16px }
  .extras-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 12px }
  .extra { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 14px 16px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.03) }
  .extra b { display: block; font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-size: 15px }
  .extra span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px }
  .glass h3 { font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-size: 30px; margin: 80px 0 12px; transform: translateZ(35px) }
  .glass p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 320px; transform: translateZ(22px) }
  .card-line { position: absolute; left: 27px; right: 27px; bottom: 28px; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,var(--red),transparent) }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr }
    .extras-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr }
    .glass { min-height: 280px }
  }
</style>
